Subject: Preserve original inventory, texture animation, manager and resource-pool source
Upstream-base: 9046e67aa2077a7eb4ed6e28c9df3c1d3b368f84

Restore original game-side resource timing, selection, registration, allocation
and release decisions; adapt Wii36-byte animation headers/8-byte frames,
pointer-width pool addresses and matching native owning-arena frees. Keep
prior static resource replicas and validation policies explicitly diagnostic.
The whole original provider scan is not a game link/readiness claim.

